msgid "petDescription/dog_1"
msgstr ""
"The German Shepherd moved silently across the battlefield, senses keen. When"
" a blast floored its handler, the dog dragged the fallen man to cover and "
"shielded him until rescue came. Wounded but loyal, never leaving his side. A"
" true soldier's guardian."

msgid "petDescription/dog_2"
msgstr ""
"Always eager for adventure, this lively Labrador is a loyal companion who "
"barks approvingly at the sound of human laughter and wags his tail when "
"making new friends. Rumor has it he's been seen in two places at once, "
"though nobody has yet worked out how."

