msgid "synergyTooltip/description/done"
msgstr ""
"Each level of pet synergy strengthens your friendship. With a Battle Comrade"
" at your side, you couldn't ask for a finer ally. If you are inactive for a "
"long time, this level will decrease."

msgid "synergyTooltip/description/inProgress"
